      "simplified": "女人又说：“好！”",
      "traditional": "女人又說：“好！”",
      "pinyin": "nǚ rén yòu shuō hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The woman again said: “Fine!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "男人转身，含着泪走了99步。",
      "traditional": "男人轉身，含著淚走了99步。",
      "pinyin": "nán rén zhuǎn shēn hán zhe lèi zǒu le 3 bù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "最后忍不住回头，却看到女人就站在自己身后。",
      "traditional": "最後忍不住回頭，卻看到女人就站在自己身後。",
      "pinyin": "zuì hòu rěn bu zhù huí tóu què kàn dào nǚ rén jiù zhàn zài zì jǐ shēn hòu",
      "english": "The man turned around, and walked 99 steps with tears in his eyes."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Finally he couldn't take it anymore and turned around, only to find the woman standing right behind him."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "女人看着他，说：“只要你肯回头，你会发现我一直在你身后！”",
      "traditional": "女人看著他，說：“只要你肯回頭，你會發現我一直在你身後！”",
      "pinyin": "nǚ rén kàn zhe tā shuō zhǐ yào nǐ kěn huí tóu nǐ huì fā xiàn wǒ yì zhí zài nǐ shēn hòu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The woman looked at him and said: “As long as you are willing to turn around you will find that I'm always behind you!”"
    },
